{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminas: Parasite Reign, a fast-paced rogue-lite where magic meets chaos and party strategy defines survival. Control up to three unique Luminas, magical beings fighting back against the monstrous Parasites corrupting the world of Solaris Land. With waves of enemies, epic boss battles, and evolving abilities, every run is a fight for survival and a chance to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 Luminas</strong>, each with <strong>unique spells and playstyles</strong>. Mix and match their powers to discover <strong>spell synergies.</strong> The key to victory lies in how you <strong>combine your Luminas</strong>, not just how you control them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Powerful Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold by defeating enemies during your run and spend it to buy <strong>powerful treasures</strong> that define your playstyle. Each Lumina has four treasure slots, one for <strong>Gear, Elixir, Artifact, and Echo</strong>. With over 90 treasures available, you\u2019ll shape your party\u2019s strengths run after run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures aren\u2019t locked</strong>, freely swap them between Luminas at any time to adapt your strategy on the fly. Go all-in on offense, build a tanky support, or stack buffs on your main DPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite combos, build the ultimate Lumina, and survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolution: unleash hidden power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As runs progress, Luminas: Parasite Reign can enter a state of <strong>Evolution,</strong> unlocking new traits, enhanced stats, and passive bonuses unique to their style. Each Evolution brings a spike in power, encouraging different builds and strategies depending on how you\u2019ve shaped your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We\u2019re Building This With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches with our signature 25-minute survival mode. Stay alive, unlock treasures, experiment with parties, fight unique parasites &amp; bosses and push your mastery further with every playthrough. Luminas: Parasite Reign is built by a small indie team obsessed with fantasy worlds, rpg elemetns, party-based roguelites, and deep replayability. Your feedback in Early Access will help shape new modes, Luminas, spells, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to awaken the power within and stand against the Parasite tide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=189 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Solaris Land. Build your party. Survive the storm.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724100?t=1758897781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/6244bd03c7bfb5108621a1a4d248c584f8ad6edf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758897781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/ad593f088704c756a4496aec5e62a5c86eb6ca02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758897781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/ad593f088704c756a4496aec5e62a5c86eb6ca02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758897781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminas: Parasite Reign, a fast-paced rogue-lite where magic meets chaos and party strategy defines survival. Control up to three unique Luminas, magical beings fighting back against the monstrous Parasites corrupting the world of Solaris Land. With waves of enemies, epic boss battles, and evolving abilities, every run is a fight for survival and a chance to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 Luminas</strong>, each with <strong>unique spells and playstyles</strong>. Mix and match their powers to discover <strong>spell synergies.</strong> The key to victory lies in how you <strong>combine your Luminas</strong>, not just how you control them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/57d20183dbc1522225a4b302ffe8e4be.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Powerful Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold by defeating enemies during your run and spend it to buy <strong>powerful treasures</strong> that define your playstyle. Each Lumina has four treasure slots, one for <strong>Gear, Elixir, Artifact, and Echo</strong>. With over 90 treasures available, you\u2019ll shape your party\u2019s strengths run after run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures aren\u2019t locked</strong>, freely swap them between Luminas at any time to adapt your strategy on the fly. Go all-in on offense, build a tanky support, or stack buffs on your main DPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite combos, build the ultimate Lumina, and survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/8a0bdffc8a75deda93c6f67f9db4e39e.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolution: unleash hidden power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As runs progress, Luminas: Parasite Reign can enter a state of <strong>Evolution,</strong> unlocking new traits, enhanced stats, and passive bonuses unique to their style. Each Evolution brings a spike in power, encouraging different builds and strategies depending on how you\u2019ve shaped your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/4c3b303a5f92d28bdf00bb8603eb8900.mp4?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We\u2019re Building This With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches with our signature 25-minute survival mode. Stay alive, unlock treasures, experiment with parties, fight unique parasites &amp; bosses and push your mastery further with every playthrough. Luminas: Parasite Reign is built by a small indie team obsessed with fantasy worlds, rpg elemetns, party-based roguelites, and deep replayability. Your feedback in Early Access will help shape new modes, Luminas, spells, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to awaken the power within and stand against the Parasite tide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.poster.avif?t=1758897781\" width=189 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.webm?t=1758897781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Solaris Land. Build your party. Survive the storm.</strong></p>","developers":["SOTO Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/840ef411ecd334b406518567bd5eb47bfdb9e0cb/header.jpg?t=1758897781","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724100/1123232882/d608fe3e9aca2db06ba376f05b70b889a13e6f3c/1751453675/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751455592","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724100/1123232882/d608fe3e9aca2db06ba376f05b70b889a13e6f3c/1751453675/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751455592","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724100/1123232882/d608fe3e9aca2db06ba376f05b70b889a13e6f3c/1751453675/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751455592","id":257164